EXTENSION "ARM5e_Spells_Ignem" {
    NAME "Ars Magica 5th Edition Definitive - Ignem Spells"
    VERSION "0.1"
    RELEASE_DATE "2025-06-01"
    DEPENDS_ON "ARM5e_Core_Magic"

    # Ignem Form spells: affect fire, heat, and light.
    # Basic Individual: a fire about the size of a large campfire.
    # Organized by Technique, then by Level.

    # ===========================
    # CREO IGNEM GUIDELINES
    # ===========================
    # Level 1:  Create light equivalent to moonlight.
    # Level 2:  Create light equivalent to candlelight.
    #           Heat an object to be warm to the touch.
    #           Ignite something extremely flammable (like oil or a wick).
    # Level 3:  Create light equivalent to torchlight.
    #           Heat an object to be hot to the touch.
    #           Ignite something very flammable (like parchment).
    # Level 4:  Create a fire doing +5 damage.
    #           Create light as bright as a cloudy day.
    #           Ignite something flammable (like dry wood or charcoal).
    #           Heat an object enough to boil water.
    # Level 5:  Create a fire doing +10 damage.
    #           Create a fire doing +5 damage in an unnatural shape.
    #           Create light as bright as direct sunlight on a clear day.
    #           Ignite something slightly flammable (like leather or damp wood).
    #           Heat an object enough to make it glow red-hot (melt tin or lead).
    # Level 10: Create a fire doing +15 damage.
    #           Create a fire doing +10 damage in an unnatural shape.
    #           Ignite something barely flammable (like a human body).
    #           Heat an object enough to make it glow white-hot (melt most metals and many rocks).
    # Level 15: Create a fire doing +20 damage.
    # Level 20: Create a fire doing +25 damage.
    #           Create a fire doing +20 damage in an unnatural shape.
    # Level 25: Create a fire doing +30 damage.
    #           Create a fire elemental from a base amount of elemental matter. (Ritual)

    # ===========================
    # CREO IGNEM SPELLS
    # ===========================

    #ARME80aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ0k ^"Moonbeam" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 3
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 1, +1 Touch, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME80bC3dE5fG7hI9jK1l: Causes a gentle light, bright enough to read by, to shine down from above and illuminate the area described by your encircled arms. Lasts as long as you hold your arms in a circle.
        }
    }

    #ARME81aD4eF6gH8iJ0kL2m ^"Palm of Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 5
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +1 Touch, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME81bE5fG7hI9jK1lM3n: A flame leaps up in your palm, which must be upturned for the spell's duration. The flame casts light like a torch, and can ignite very flammable items. It does no damage, and does not burn the caster.
        }
    }

    #ARME82aF6gH8iJ0kL2mN4o ^"Heat of the Searing Forge" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 4, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME82bG7hI9jK1lM3nO5p: Heats a piece of metal so that it is too hot to touch. Something the size of a breastplate or helmet does +5 damage if in direct contact with the skin for one round. For each additional round, more damage is done, the amount dropping by two points each round (+3 damage on round two, then +1). Smaller objects do less damage. Most metal armor has leather or cloth underneath that gives the victim a +3 Soak bonus against the heat.
        }
    }

    #ARME83aH8iJ0kL2mN4oP6q ^"Lamp Without Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 4, +1 Touch, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME83bI9jK1lM3nO5pQ7r: Creates a steady light as bright as daylight on a cloudy day. The light has no apparent source, but illuminates an area about ten paces across, centered on a point indicated by the caster. This point may be a mobile item.
        }
    }

    #ARME84aJ0kL2mN4oP6qR8s ^"Blade of the Virulent Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 15
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Diameter"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 5, +1 Touch, +1 Diameter"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME84bK1lM3nO5pQ7rS9t: Forms a fire along the length of a metal blade. This flame doubles the weapon damage score for the blade (or adds +5, whichever is greater), and can start fires as well. If the spell is cast repeatedly on the same blade, the blade gets hot enough to melt after half an hour, which ends the spell. Letting the blade cool for half an hour between castings avoids this.
        }
    }

    #ARME85aL2mN4oP6qR8sT0u ^"Flash of the Scarlet Flames" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 15
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 5, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME85bM3nO5pQ7rS9tU1v: A brilliant red flash explodes in the air where you designate. If you target a person's face the target needs a Stamina stress roll against an Ease Factor of 9 to avoid temporary blindness. If the target botches the roll, he is permanently blinded. If temporarily blinded, he can try to make a simple Stamina roll against an Ease Factor of 9 each minute to recover. The flash is equivalent to looking straight at the sun.
        }
    }

    #ARME86aN4oP6qR8sT0uV2w ^"Pilum of Fire" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 10, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME86bO5pQ7rS9tU1vW3x: A 2-foot, thick, spear-shaped jet of fire flies from your palms, doing +15 damage to the individual it hits.
        }
    }

    #ARME87aP6qR8sT0uV2wX4y ^"Arc of Fiery Ribbons" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Group"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 5, +2 Voice, +2 Group"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME87bQ7rS9tU1vW3xY5z: A dozen multi-hued ribbons of flame leap from your hands and fly out as far as your voice carries, covering a 60-degree arc. All those in the arc take +10 damage.
        }
    }

    #ARME88aR8sT0uV2wX4yZ6a ^"Coat of Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Diameter"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Requisite" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 5, +2 Voice, +1 Diam, +1 Rego requisite"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME88bS9tU1vW3xY5zA7b: The target is swathed in fire, and takes +5 damage every round while the spell is in effect. That is, the damage must be rolled against Soak twenty times during the spell. The Rego requisite ensures that the fire does not spread.
        }
    }

    #ARME89aT0uV2wX4yZ6aB8c ^"Ball of Abysmal Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 25, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME89bU1vW3xY5zA7bC9d: A ball of flame shoots from your hand to strike a single target, doing +30 damage. The ball appearing to shoot from your hand is a cosmetic effect.
        }
    }

    #ARME8AaV2wX4yZ6aB8cD0e ^"Circle of Encompassing Flames" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Creo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 20, +2 Voice, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME8AbW3xY5zA7bC9dE1f: Creates a circle of flames 6 feet high. The circle begins at a 1-pace radius, but you can make it shrink to a pillar or grow to a 3-pace radius as you concentrate if you cast with a Rego requisite. Anyone moving through the flames takes +20 damage. You cannot move the center of the circle.
        }
    }

    # ===========================
    # INTELLEGO IGNEM GUIDELINES
    # ===========================
    # Intellego Ignem botches typically provide false information,
    # although they may also render the caster incapable of detecting
    # heat or flames for a time.
    #
    # Level 1:  Sense one property of a fire. Locate a fire.
    # Level 2:  Sense all mundane properties of a fire.
    #           Become aware of all fires within the target area.
    #           See a fire. Sense levels of heat.
    # Level 3:  Sense all mundane properties of ash.
    #           Detect the traces of fires which burned within the last lunar month.
    # Level 4:  See clearly through raging fire (Auram requisite may be needed for smoke).
    #           Learn the magical properties of a fire.
    # Level 10: See a fire and all things it illuminates.
    # Level 20: Speak with a fire.

    # ===========================
    # INTELLEGO IGNEM SPELLS
    # ===========================

    #ARME8BaX4yZ6aB8cD0eF2g ^"Tales of the Ashes" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Intellego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 5
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +1 Touch, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME8BbY5zA7bC9dE1fG3h: Lets you see what the ashes you touch originally were, and how and when the object was burned. The latter two are divined from markings and signs in the ashes.
        }
    }

    #ARME8CaZ6aB8cD0eF2gH4i ^"Shadows of the Fires Past" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Intellego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 15
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Personal"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Vision"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +4 Vision"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME8CbA7bC9dE1fG3hI5j: Allows you to see where fires have been in the past lunar month. A light red flickering haze appears where the fire was, and you gain an intuitive sense of when the fire was there. This spell does not look into the past, but detects the traces of fire.
        }
    }

    #ARME8DaB8cD0eF2gH4iJ6k ^"Vision of Heat's Light" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Intellego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Personal"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Sun"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Vision"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 2, +2 Sun, +4 Vision"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME8DbC9dE1fG3hI5jK7l: Allows you to see the heat of objects that are of human body temperature or hotter. Excellent for use in the dark, but it does not give true vision. You can see well enough to use a weapon, even a missile weapon, without penalty, but recognizing people is very difficult.
        }
    }

    #ARME8EaD0eF2gH4iJ6kL8m ^"Eyes of the Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Intellego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Arcane Connection"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 10, +4 Arc, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME8EbE1fG3hI5jK7lM9n: Lets you see a fire to which you have an Arcane Connection. You can also see all those things which the fire illuminates.
        }
    }

    #ARME8FaF2gH4iJ6kL8mN0o ^"Words of the Flickering Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Intellego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 20, +2 Voice, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME8FbG3hI5jK7lM9nO1p: Allows you to converse with a fire, which is commonly very chaotic and distractible. Promising a fire more fuel might keep its interest. Fires are mostly aware of what they have burned, but they have a limited awareness of what goes on around them as well.
        }
    }

    # ===========================
    # MUTO IGNEM GUIDELINES
    # ===========================
    # The intensity of a fire also affects the difficulty of changing it.
    # For every five points by which the fire's damage exceeds +5,
    # add one magnitude to the level of the spell.
    #
    # General: Convert part of a fire elemental's body into another type
    #          of fire, reducing the elemental's Might pool by the level
    #          of the spell +2 magnitudes.
    # Level 1:  Change one characteristic of a fire within the target area.
    # Level 2:  Totally change a fire into another natural fire.
    # Level 3:  Change a fire so that it is slightly unnatural (colored flames,
    #           smoke smelling of roses). May require requisites.
    # Level 4:  Change a fire so that it is completely unnatural (multicolored
    #           flames forming images while the fire plays music). Often requires requisites.
    # Level 5:  Change a fire into a natural example of another element,
    #           with an appropriate requisite.
    # Level 10: Change a fire into an unnatural example of another element,
    #           with an appropriate requisite.

    # ===========================
    # MUTO IGNEM SPELLS
    # ===========================

    #ARME90aH4iJ6kL8mN0oP2q ^"The Many-Hued Conflagration" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Muto"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 5
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME90bI5jK7lM9nO1pQ3r: Makes a fire burn brightly in shifting colors for an instant. Each being looking at the fire must make a Stamina stress roll against an Ease Factor of 6 or be blinded for one round by the multicolored lights.
        }
    }

    #ARME91aJ6kL8mN0oP2qR4s ^"Show of the Flames and Smoke" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Muto"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +2 Voice, +1 Conc"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME91bK7lM9nO1pQ3rS5t: Causes smoke of different colors, streams of flame, and strange popping and sizzling noises to come from a fire. The effect is so spectacular that onlookers are either entranced or horrified, depending on the circumstances. The pyrotechnics might ignite nearby flammable objects and cause minor burns to those within 2 paces of the fire.
        }
    }

    #ARME92aL8mN0oP2qR4sT6u ^"Hornet Fire" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Muto"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Requisite" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 2, +2 Voice, +1 Conc, +1 Rego requisite"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME92bM9nO1pQ3rS5tU7v: Turns a fire into a swarm of fireballs, each the size of a large insect, that fly and harass at your command. Their burning touch gives one person within range both a -3 penalty on all rolls and two extra botch dice, but they do not cause actual damage.
        }
    }

    #ARME93aN0oP2qR4sT6uV8w ^"Prison of Flames" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Muto"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Sun"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +2 Voice, +2 Sun, +1 Size"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME93bO1pQ3rS5tU7vW9x: Turns a bonfire into a prison shaped like a miniature castle. A person thrown into the middle is not burned, but takes +15 damage if he or she tries to escape.
        }
    }

    #ARME94aP2qR4sT6uV8wX0y ^"Trapping the Fire" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Muto"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Sun"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Requisite" ENUM ["Terram"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 5, +2 Voice, +2 Sun, requisite is free"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME94bQ3rS5tU7vW9xY1z: This spell turns the heat and flames of a large campfire into a small, very hard object, such as a gem or a piece of metal. If the object is broken, the flame returns, but dies if there is nothing to burn.
        }
    }

    #ARME95aR4sT6uV8wX0yZ2a ^"Flames of Sculpted Ice" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Muto"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Sun"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Requisite" ENUM ["Aquam"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 5, +2 Voice, +2 Sun, +2 size"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME95bS5tU7vW9xY1zA3b: Turns a fire up to the size of a small house into ice. The ice forms beautiful sculptures of leaping flame, until it begins to melt. When the ice has melted halfway, the flames start again, but probably will not spread, because of wet surroundings.
        }
    }

    # ===========================
    # PERDO IGNEM GUIDELINES
    # ===========================
    # The intensity of a fire also affects the difficulty of destroying it.
    # For every five points by which the fire's damage exceeds +5,
    # add one magnitude to the level of the spell.
    # Perdo Ignem botches might create fire instead of destroying it,
    # or freeze the caster.
    #
    # General: Destroy sufficient matter to reduce a fire elemental's
    #          Might Score by the level of the spell +2 magnitudes.
    # Level 2:  Greatly reduce the amount of light in an area.
    # Level 3:  Completely extinguish all light in an area.
    #           Reduce the size of a fire without destroying it completely.
    # Level 4:  Extinguish a fire, cooling the ashes to merely warm.
    #           Chill an object.
    #           Chill a person so that they lose a Fatigue level.
    # Level 5:  Strongly chill an object (e.g. freeze water).
    #           Chill a person so that they take +5 damage.
    # Level 10: Destroy one aspect of a fire (e.g. heat or light).
    #           Chill a person so strongly that they take +10 damage.

    # ===========================
    # PERDO IGNEM SPELLS
    # ===========================

    #ARME96aT6uV8wX0yZ2aB4c ^"Gloom of Evening" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Diameter"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Room"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 2, +1 Touch, +1 Diam, +2 Room"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME96bU7vW9xY1zA3bC5d: The level of light in the target room drops substantially, making the room gloomy, with deep shadows everywhere.
        }
    }

    #ARME97aV8wX0yZ2aB4cD6e ^"Winter's Icy Touch" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 4, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME97bW9xY1zA3bC5dE7f: Causes the target to feel a chill and lose body heat. The target loses a Fatigue level.
        }
    }

    #ARME98aX0yZ2aB4cD6eF8g ^"Soothe the Raging Flames" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 10, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME98bY1zA3bC5dE7fG9h: Eradicates the heat of a bonfire, which, however, continues to burn until the fuel already covered in flame is consumed. The flames do not spread, or harm anything beyond what they were already burning. If the fire is extinguished and relit, it will burn hot again, as it is now a different fire.
        }
    }

    #ARME99aZ2aB4cD6eF8gH0i ^"Well Without Light" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Sun"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Structure"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +1 Touch, +2 Sun, +3 Str"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME99bA3bC5dE7fG9hI1j: Removes light from the target structure. Only spells greater than level 25 can create light within this area. When casting this spell, magi typically clench a hand into a fist, and the light flows into the fist like a living entity, until the entire area is dark.
        }
    }

    #ARME9AaB4cD6eF8gH0iJ2k ^"Conjuration of the Indubitable Cold" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Part"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 4, +2 Voice, +1 Part, +2 size"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME9AbC5dE7fG9hI1jK3l: Cools the air within ten paces of the target, leaving it slightly below freezing. All nonliving things are chilled thoroughly, not just on the surface. All living things (except you, if you cast with a Rego requisite) lose one Fatigue level. House fires become as small as campfires, bonfires become as small as torch fires, and campfires and smaller fires go out.
        }
    }

    #ARME9BaD6eF8gH0iJ2kL4m ^"Wizard's Icy Grip" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 30
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 20, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME9BbE7fG9hI1jK3lM5n: Chills a single target so that it takes +20 damage. If this is enough to kill, the target is frozen solid. Armor does not add to Soak against this spell.
        }
    }

    #ARME9CaF8gH0iJ2kL4mN6o ^"Wizard's Eclipse" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Perdo"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Diameter"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Boundary"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN true
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 2, +1 Touch, +1 Diam, +4 Bound, +3 size"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME9CbG9hI1jK3lM5nO7p: The sun is eclipsed within the target area, making it as dark as night. The darkness begins very suddenly. The superstitious are likely to panic, especially if they see that there is normal daylight just beyond the boundary of the spell.
        }
    }

    # ===========================
    # REGO IGNEM GUIDELINES
    # ===========================
    # The intensity of a fire also affects the difficulty of controlling it.
    # For every five points by which the fire's damage exceeds +5,
    # add one magnitude to the level of the spell.
    # Rego Ignem spells can control heat or light as well as fire.
    # Rego Ignem botches normally result in the fire doing exactly
    # what the caster does not want.
    #
    # General: Ward against beings associated with Ignem from one
    #          supernatural realm (Divine, Faerie, Infernal, or Magic)
    #          with Might less than or equal to the level of the spell.
    #          (Touch, Ring, Circle)
    # Level 3:  Control a fire in a natural fashion (e.g. control its direction of spread).
    #           Move a fire quickly through space while leaving it burning naturally.
    #           Transport a fire instantly up to 5 paces (+1 mag for 50 paces,
    #           +2 mag for 500 paces, +3 mag for 1 league, +4 mag for seven leagues,
    #           +5 mag for Arcane Connection range).
    # Level 4:  Control a fire in a slightly unnatural fashion (e.g. stop it from burning a person).
    # Level 5:  Control a disembodied spirit associated with Ignem.
    #           Completely control a fire elemental.
    # Level 10: Control a fire in a very unnatural fashion (e.g. fashion into a dancing humanoid shape).
    # Level 15: Summon a disembodied spirit associated with Ignem.
    #           Ward against fire doing up to +5 damage. (Touch, Ring, Circle)
    # Level 20: Ward against fire doing up to +10 damage. (Touch, Ring, Circle)
    # Level 25: Ward against fire doing up to +15 damage. (Touch, Ring, Circle)
    # Level 30: Ward against fire doing up to +20 damage. (Touch, Ring, Circle)
    # Level 35: Ward against fire doing up to +25 damage. (Touch, Ring, Circle)
    # Level 40: Ward against fire doing up to +30 damage. (Touch, Ring, Circle)

    # ===========================
    # REGO IGNEM SPELLS
    # ===========================

    #ARME9DaH0iJ2kL4mN6oP8q ^"Tremulous Vault of the Torch's Flame" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 5
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +2 Voice"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME9DbI1jK3lM5nO7pQ9r: Causes a fire to quiver a few seconds and then make a leap of up to 10 feet in any direction. A Targeting roll is required to hit a specific target. The flame stays at the spot it hits if it can burn there. Otherwise, it simply scorches the spot and goes out (doing +5 damage).
        }
    }

    #ARME9EaJ2kL4mN6oP8qR0s ^"Leap of the Fire" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 10
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +2 Voice, +1 size"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME9EbK3lM5nO7pQ9rS1t: Causes a bonfire to make a leap of up to 10 paces in any direction, where it catches if there is fuel, or burns out if there is not.
        }
    }

    #ARME9FaL4mN6oP8qR0sT2u ^"Light Shaft of the Night" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Voice"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Concentration"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Group"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 3, +2 Voice, +1 Conc, +2 Group"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARME9FbM5nO7pQ9rS1tU3v: Concentrates starlight and moonlight to produce light nearly equal to sunlight (if the moon is not out). If the sky is overcast, the spell does not work. Can only be cast under the night sky.
        }
    }

    #ARMEA0aN6oP8qR0sT2uV4w ^"Burst of the Sweeping Flames" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Sight"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Momentary"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 10 (4 + 2 magnitudes for intensity of the fire), +3 Sight"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARMEA0bO7pQ9rS1tU3vW5x: Causes a fire to sweep outwards from its source along the ground, as if a giant wind were blowing on it from above. The fire ferociously ignites anything in its path. The original fire is left dead, but in all probability a number of new fires will be started. The flames cause +5 to +15 damage, depending on the intensity of the original fire.
        }
    }

    #ARMEA1aP8qR0sT2uV4wX6y ^"Ward Against Heat and Flames" DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Magus"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" ENUM ["Spell"]
            ^"Technique" ENUM ["Rego"]
            ^"Form" ENUM ["Ignem"]
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Range" ENUM ["Touch"]
            ^"Duration" ENUM ["Sun"]
            ^"Target" ENUM ["Individual"]
            ^"Ritual" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Design" TEXT "Base 4, +2 for up to +15 damage, +1 Touch, +2 Sun"
        }
        RULES {
            #ARMEA1bQ9rS1tU3vW5xY7z: Keeps heat and fire at bay, unable to approach within a couple of inches of the target. This renders the target immune to damage from flames or heat of intensity less than that of molten iron. The target gets a +15 Soak against all fire-related damage. Any fire doing less than +15 damage per round does not penetrate the ward. Such fires simply dim at the protected person's passing and flare back up after he or she is gone.
        }
    }
}
